    "open_questions": [
      "The filing does not isolate mortgage origination scores. Until it does, any percent of profit \"at risk\" is a guess and is kept out of the base path.",
      "Rival fee levels quoted in the press are not in the 10-K or 10-Q.",
      "Whether Rocket's preference becomes industry practice is a 2026–2027 volume question, not a fact in the June quarter."
